      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly updated priorities when the episode changed: surgery occurred, negative pressure was used and later removed, antibiotic-order uncertainty was clarified, and discharge became the next task. These changes altered the family’s immediate monitoring and escalation plan.",
