          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced avoiding old ointments and following ward orders.",
          "quote": "绝对不用旧药膏"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not accept 'no allergy' at face value; the topical-drug reaction was escalated, documented as uncertain, and old topical medications were avoided unless verified by the treating team.",
