        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00618",
          "explanation": "Doctor kept future surgery dependent on the treating team’s reassessment.",
          "quote": "后续是否手术，取决于接下来两三天"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although the family ultimately proceeded through operative and negative-pressure care, the doctor preserved the boundary that surgical decisions depend on direct wound-team reassessment and did not replace that decision online.",
